{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/a9f90b5b352b784b2b5162d93afa0fb3.poster.avif?t=1765191179\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/a9f90b5b352b784b2b5162d93afa0fb3.webm?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/a9f90b5b352b784b2b5162d93afa0fb3.mp4?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 Love isn\u2019t science. It\u2019s reality TV!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Heartbeat House\u2014the spiciest romance experience set in Hong Kong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget Netflix. Forget YouTube. This is a villa where eight young strangers live together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They eat, laugh, argue, flirt, date, and maybe\u2026 fall in love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And guess what? You\u2019re part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/3d6937489426e9482c2e47bd651e1bda.poster.avif?t=1765191179\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/3d6937489426e9482c2e47bd651e1bda.webm?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/3d6937489426e9482c2e47bd651e1bda.mp4?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad What You\u2019ll Actually Do</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Choose Your Romance:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who do you want to date? It\u2019s your call. No boring \u201cforced romance\u201d storylines here\u2014you can pursue, be pursued, or stir up total chaos as the lovable troublemaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Branching Side Stories:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main story is juicy, but the side stories? Even juicier. Each character hides secrets. Play once, and you\u2019ll miss half the drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.poster.avif?t=1765191179\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.webm?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/ce42851339efda73130bde655d518d1b.mp4?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>So Much Hong Kong:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streets, restaurants, and city vibes recreated from real-life Hong Kong. Order wonton noodles in-game, then wonder why they cost so much in real life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Full Cantonese Voice Acting:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every line voiced in authentic Cantonese. No generic dubbing\u2014this is the real deal. (Warning: you might pick up \u201cChi Sin Ah!\u201d as your new favorite exclamation.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Hand-drawn Characters:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, hand-drawn. These characters have soul, charm, and too many cute expressions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/87ba2d77bdad2f311e9507c28bd7d022.poster.avif?t=1765191179\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/87ba2d77bdad2f311e9507c28bd7d022.webm?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/87ba2d77bdad2f311e9507c28bd7d022.mp4?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>\ud83d\udc96 Why Play?</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because dating games are usually predictable. Heartbeats House isn\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the thrill of being inside a real romance reality show.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taste the sweet, sour, and awkward flavors of love, rejection, and jealousy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in the authentic Hong Kong vibe\u2014it\u2019s more immersive than binge-watching a drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay up way too late, then tell your friends: \u201cSorry, I was busy dating in a Hong Kong villa.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/27fc4eae56df6ec97475473ca6e7756a.poster.avif?t=1765191179\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/27fc4eae56df6ec97475473ca6e7756a.webm?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/27fc4eae56df6ec97475473ca6e7756a.mp4?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>\ud83c\udfa4 Love. Drama. You.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a boring \u201cvisual novel on autopilot.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices raise heart rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These characters will make you question: \u201cAm I talking to a game\u2026 or to someone real?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just romance\u2014it\u2019s romance + gossip + freedom + a dash of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>\u2728TL;DR:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartbeat House \u2014 A romance reality show where you are the star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find true love, or just beautiful heartbreak?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/c7d4f347a36a06daadb44a8ef86f0442.poster.avif?t=1765191179\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/c7d4f347a36a06daadb44a8ef86f0442.webm?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/extras/c7d4f347a36a06daadb44a8ef86f0442.mp4?t=1765191179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131900?t=1765191179","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/cfd04c6fc32accae7eb4d61fbbe2399de70aab1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765191179","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/62846c62ca9173d9730604b2c9e9d91e90f9c254/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765191179","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131900/62846c62ca9173d9730604b2c9e9d91e90f9c254/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765191179","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4228780,"description":""}]